sequenceDiagram
 actor Cashier
 participant Device as Device / IndexedDB
 participant API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Cashier->>Device: Confirm cash received
 Device->>Device: Atomic sale + payment + stock delta + outbox
 Device-->>Cashier: Local receipt / pending
 Device->>API: Frozen client UUID
 API->>DB: Validate + atomic posting + unique UUID
 DB-->>API: Committed
 API--xDevice: Response lost
 Device->>API: Retry unchanged UUID
 API-->>Device: Existing committed receipt
 Device->>Device: ACK + stock watermark reconciliation
